# Talk Again — environment variables.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values. `.env.local` is
# gitignored. None of these are ever shipped to the browser — only the Vercel
# Serverless functions (api/*.ts) and the Vite dev-mode API proxy read them.
#
# We deliberately do NOT use Vite's `VITE_` prefix here, so a stray
# `import.meta.env.ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` in client code resolves to `undefined`
# rather than leaking the key into the bundle.

# ─── Voice synthesis (Step 1.5) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Sign up at https://elevenlabs.io (free tier OK)
# 2. Voices → Voice Design → describe an elderly Korean male voice → save it
# 3. Grab the resulting voice_id and put it here
# 4. Profile → API Keys → create a restricted key (Text-to-Speech: Access,
#    Voices: Read, Models: Access, everything else No Access)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=sk_...
ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=...
# eleven_turbo_v2_5 → Korean explicit + lower latency. Other options:
#   eleven_multilingual_v2  (older, slips on short Korean phrases)
#   eleven_flash_v2_5       (lowest latency, similar quality)
#   eleven_v3               (newest alpha — best quality, slower)
ELEVENLABS_MODEL_ID=eleven_turbo_v2_5

# ─── AI suggestions (Step 4) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
